### VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health (public)
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "alice", "password": "alice-password"}

### Login: the token is captured automatically (REST Client)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "alice", "password": "alice-password"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Me
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open account
# @name acc
POST {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Main"}

###
@account = {{acc.response.body.id}}

### Deposit
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"toAccount": "{{account}}", "amount": 1000, "currency": "USD", "type": "deposit"}

### Withdrawal
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "{{account}}", "amount": 50.25, "currency": "USD", "type": "withdrawal"}

### Validation error
POST {{base}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "12345", "amount": -10.555, "currency": "XYZ", "type": "transfer"}

### List with filters
GET {{base}}/transactions?accountId={{account}}&type=deposit&from=2024-01-01&to=2099-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Balance
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{account}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Summary
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{account}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unauthorized (no token) -> 401
GET {{base}}/transactions
